<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls slightly at Italy CCT auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls slightly at Italy CCT auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a fifth tranche of 1.5 trillion lire of seven-year Italian Treasury floating rate certificates (CCTs) paying a first coupon of 3.8 percent.</p>
<p>		   Nov 1, 2003 CCT	 pvs</p>
<p>    Net Yield	   6.15 pct	 6.16</p>
<p>    Gross yield	 7.05 pct	 7.07</p>
<p>    Assigned price	100.95     100.95</p>
<p>    Total bids	  3.111 trillion lire</p>
<p>    Assigned	    1.500 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with an auction of a third tranche of the 3.8 percent CCTs on November 28.</p>
</text>
